# ==============================================================================
# WORKFLOWX AI - MULTI-TIER ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION GUIDE
# ==============================================================================
# WorkFlowX AI enforces strict security segregation between Server and Client:
#
# 1. BACKEND CONFIGURATION:
#    Location: ./backend/.env
#    Template: ./backend/.env.example
#    Scope:    Private server-side credentials (Supabase Service Key, Gemini API Key,
#              JWT Secrets, CORS Whitelists). NEVER expose to client bundles.
#
# 2. FRONTEND CONFIGURATION:
#    Location: ./frontend/.env
#    Template: ./frontend/.env.example
#    Scope:    Public client-side Vite variables (VITE_API_URL, VITE_APP_NAME).
#              Exposed to browser via Vite bundle.
#
# Quick Setup:
#   cp backend/.env.example backend/.env
#   cp frontend/.env.example frontend/.env
# ==============================================================================
